$(0,1)$ with the measure $d\mu(\rho)=\rho^{d-1}d\rho$, so that
$\mu(0,\rho)=\rho^{d}/d$ and
$\norm{g}_{L^{2}(D)}^{2}=\int_{\mathbb S^{d-1}}\norm{\gamma}_{L^{2}(d\mu)}^{2}
