## Headline
G1/G2/G3 NOT resolved; upper bound unproved in four independent places (two of them new, found by re-derivation, including one that falsifies the final risk display as printed). B-6 incompletely resolved with new internal contradiction. Lower bound sound. Rate consistent (mode-wise counting). COMPLETE not warranted.

## Part 1 — findings (classified)
### Mainline gaps
- M1 (G1, NEW, fatal): absorption display arithmetically false (sum direction: ∑_{j:2^{-j}≥δ}2^{-jα} = O(1), not O(δ^α)); single-δ absorption provably impossible (bootstrap can't start; GN threshold (1+√(1+2d))/2); so "valid for all α>1" false as written.
- M2 (G1, NEW, fatal): the rδ^α bias term in eq:basic, after division by δ, yields r²δ_*^{2α-2} = r²n^{-(2α-2)/(2α+d+2)} — silently dropped in the final display; as printed the document proves a SLOWER rate. Directive: ||Z|| ≲ δ^{1+α} (kill rδ^α) via order-(-1) smoothing on fine scales (provable by lem:Linv(iii) H^{-1}→L² + ||e||_{H^{-1}} ≲ δ||e||).
- M3 (G2, NEW, fatal): lem:invert(iii) Pythagoras invalid — middle band C_1δ||h|| (C_1 ≥ c) can't be subtracted; claimed (c²-c²/4) uses only far tail. Directive: cutoff projection P̃ at ηδ^{-2} (+Ṽ sieve projected dimension change), tail ≤ Cη^{-1}δ||h||, choose η.
- M4 (G2/G3, reopened): origin modes are HARDER not easier (Γ_λ = δ_λ(δ_λ+|x_λ|) is SMALL at |x|=0); rem:modewise/eq:infsupapp "never inverted"/"stronger gain" are wrong-direction; origin components of sieve error are currently uncontrolled. Mode-wise risk allocation REQUIRED (counting verified by this reviewer: minimax rate unchanged; possible benign d=2 log).
- M5 (G3, reopened): "off-diagonals Schur-summable ⇒ dominated" unjustified; plain Schur at 4δ separation does NOT dominate (sphere-average decay (4k)^{-(d-1)/2} sums diverge for d ≥ 2; restriction-theory obstruction). Directive: physical-space energy proof (exact ||Lg||² packet identity; variational ||Tg|| ≥ ||Lg||²_{H^{-1}_D}/||Lg||₂; diagonal two-sided via scaling, off-diag O(δ²) via ∫ψ=0 dipole) — deletes lem:ao and lem:harmonic (page reclaim).
- M6 (G2(i)): cross-scale AO <Th_j,Th_{j'}> asserted not proved (lem:ao is intra-scale); directive: prove |<Th_λ,Th_μ>| ≤ C2^{-|j-k|}(Γ_λ||h_λ||)(Γ_μ||h_μ||) via band-localization + Δ_D^{-2}-smoothing.

### Blocking side issues
- B-6 REOPENED: normalization remark asserts "u_f ≤ 0" under the -1 source (false: solutions are ≥ 0); lem:apriori(i) concluding display contradicts its own derivation (positive barriers vs printed negative conclusion). Directive: global +1 swap (u_0 = (|x|²-1)/2d etc.), delete normalization paragraph.
- B-10 NEW (opdiff): "the packet h is supported in {|x|≤3/4}" false for general sieve differences; interior-only Schauder unusable at the boundary. Directive: global C^{1,γ}(D̄) Schauder for u_m - u_0 (m ∈ C^{0,γ} on D̄, α>1) ⇒ ||∇(u_m-u_0)||_∞ ≲ r on all D; then opdiff bound for all sieve h; Γ-version per mode.
- B-9 residual: Prop Step 1 "=" display retained with contradictory parenthetical; replace by ≍.
- Page budget: 16/16 zero margin; Round-2 mode-wise rebuild needs +1–1.5pp; directive trims: delete lem:ao, delete lem:harmonic, compress rem:const/rem:modewise/rem:degree1/§6, B-6 paragraph removal.

